{"id":"NCT04839705","title":"Post Approval Study - Evaluate the Long-Term Safety and Effectiveness of the WEB Device","official":"Post-Approval Study - Post-Market Surveillance Study to Evaluate the Long-Term Safety and Effectiveness of the WEB Device","summary":"A prospective, multicenter, single arm, interventional study. The target patient population for this study are adult subjects with WNBAs of the anterior and posterior intracranial circulation. The primary effectiveness outcome of the study is adequate intracranial aneurysm occlusion on the 1 year angiogram as adjudicated by a core laboratory.","conditions":["Wide Neck Bifurcation Intracranial Aneurysms"],"interventions":[{"type":"DEVICE","name":"WEB"}],"criteria":"Key Inclusion Criteria:\n\n* Patient must be ≥ 18 at the time of screening\n* Patient must have a single ruptured or unruptured IA requiring treatment\n* Patient must sign and date an IRB-approved written informed consent prior to initiation of any study procedures\n\nKey Exclusion Criteria:\n\n* Patient has an IA with characteristics unsuitable for endovascular treatment\n* Patient has conditions placing them at high risk for ischemic stroke or has exhibited ischemic symptoms such as transient ischemic attacks, minor strokes, or stroke-in-evolution within the prior 30 days\n* Patient has had an SAH from a non-index IA or any other intracranial hemorrhage within 90 days\n* Patient's index IA was previously treated\n* Patient is pregnant","minAge":"18 Years","maxAge":"","sex":"ALL","healthy":false,"studyType":"INTERVENTIONAL","purpose":"TREATMENT","enrollment":200,"start":"2022-08-24","pcd":"2027-05-08","upd":"2026-11-10","sponsor":"Microvention-Terumo, Inc.","areas":["neurology"],"central":["Robert Gash · 908-914-1045 · robert.gash@terumo.com"],"sites":[{"f":"Memorial Health Systems","city":"Hollywood","pr":"Florida","zip":"33021","s":"R","lat":26.0112,"lon":-80.1495,"c":"Piret Baldwin · 954-558-1194 · pibaldwin@mhs.net"},{"f":"Orlando Health Neur